## 0.0.3 - 2026.11
### Added
	- "Add Task" quick action on the Maintenance page with a modal form (AJAX, validated, logged).
	- "Add Reminder" quick action with repeat frequency (interval stored per reminder).
	- Maintenance tasks list view (status views, search, sortable columns, pagination, single and bulk delete).
	- "Edit" row action for maintenance tasks (edit modal with prefilled fields, save via AJAX).
	- Calendar submenu with month and week views: task and reminder events, reminder recurrence expansion, per-day "Add Task" button, and click-to-preview entry details with direct "Edit Task".
### Improved
	- Calendar grid honors the WordPress "week starts on" setting and shows full localized weekday names.
	- Maintenance events on the Current Aquarium page use the Font Awesome screwdriver-wrench icon.
### Fixed
	- Reminder table missing `user_id` and `reminder_interval` columns on older installs (migration v6).
